Local integration: built-in composite object instead of obj-m; Generic Netlink
is the default, matching the official module. The LKM-compatible kernel build
explicitly disables legacy raw Netlink.
Upstream Kconfig switches are wired to NETWORK_FILTER / LEGACY_NETLINK.

Local hardening: require CAP_NET_ADMIN for Generic Netlink monitor commands
and event-group subscriptions; keep the version query public.
